      <!-- End Static Text 1-->
      <div style = "margin-bottom: 2%">
        <div class = "staticTextHeader">Your loan will be disbursed on receipt of the following documents.</div>
        <div>
          <ul style="list-style-type:circle;">
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">Duly Signed Loan Agreement</li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">Repayment Instructions (Post-dated cheques or Debit-ECS Instructions or ACH</li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">Invoice and Insurance Policy with hypothecation in favor of AU Small Finance Bank. Duly recorder thereon Margin Money Receipt.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- End static Text2-->

      <div>
        <div class = "staticTextHeader">You are also requested to note as follows.</div>
        <div>
          <ul style="list-style-type:circle;">
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              This sanction letter is valid for 15 days from the date of issue and subject to Terms and Conditions as stated above. For any change in
              Terms and Conditions would require a fresh sanction letter.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              This must not be treated as a delivery order in respect of the vehicle.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              It is assumed that you have inspected the vehicle and satisfied yourself of the quality thereof. Bank will not be liable for any defect or delay
              in delivery or any service issue concerning the  Dealer/ Regional Transport Office / Insurance Company or any other intermediary involved in the 
              deal.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              The vehicle must be registered at either of the address mentioned above.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              Installment schedule is normally equated monthly installments (it could be quaterly or half yearly in case of Tractor loans) 
              subject to the terms and conditions of the repayment schedule and to overcome operational issues, holidays etc., it is advised to keep sufficient 
              balance in bank amount 2-3 days prior to due date of EMI, for clearance of EMI on due dates, to avoid penal interest and 
              other charges and avoid deliquency status.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              Processing fee and other charges will be applicable as per Schedule of Charges and same will be seperated from Margin money.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              All cheques must strictly be issued in favour of <b> AU Small Finance Bank </b>. The Loan agreement number ..........
               must be written on the reverse of each cheque. AU Small Finance Bank will not be responsible for any misuse of cheques that
                are not issued in the manner indicated above.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              AU shall not be liable for any failure to perform its obligations where such a failure is due to circumstances beyond its control.
            </li>
            <li class="textCSS" style = "margin-bottom : 2%; font-size : 13px !important;">
              The Final loan amount would be disbursed only on satisfactory receipts of above mentioned documents to the dealer mentioned 
              above as per your request.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
          <!--<apex:outputText escape="false" value="{!objGenericMaster.Letter_Content__c}" ></apex:outputText>-->

      </div>

      <!-- end Regards-->

      <div style="margin-top:7%; position:relative">
        <div class="textCSS" style="margin-bottom:1%">Warm Regards,<br/></div>
        <div class="textCSS"><b>AU Small Finance Bank</b></div>
      </div>
